1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Your agents write reports about work they did. This keeps the receipt.

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Watch ./demo.sh — a stranger catches a false claim with no account and no network.

3
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Pull request one — the required check goes red on deadbee, a commit that never existed.

4
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Open the hold console — record H-57b130f397, traceable back to the agent session.

5
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Four verdicts: PASS, BLOCK, UNVERIFIABLE, HOLD — and the gate never runs a command from a report.

6
00:02:40,000 --> 00:03:00,000
78,618 messages examined. 41.7% raw → 8.1% corrected — the gap was our error, not the agents'.
